  "description": "The raster renderer for DocWright: draws laid-out pages (from Word documents, Excel workbooks or SSRS reports) as PNG or JPEG, sized by DPI, pixel box or scale; its options also drive PDF-to-image conversion. No System.Drawing, no SkiaSharp and no native binaries. Integer arithmetic throughout, so a page renders byte-identically across platforms and framework versions. Installed automatically by DocWright and DocWright.Spreadsheet.Rendering.",
